{"type":"message","id":"78ad4d9b","parentId":"d36c7bd8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:29:43.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the full picture. The founder (听风) was asking on behalf of 雨娃 in a different group, and I had already answered but in this Robot Space group, so 听风 didn't see it. Now 雨娃 is asking both 听风 and me about my answers and which way I lean on Q2.\n\nThe main thing now is that this is addressing both 听风 and me. I should confirm my answers and clarify my position on Q2.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n是啊，我其实已经在 Robot Space 群交了卷，可能跨群没同步。\n\nQ2 我的立场是 A（旧版继续有效），跟其他三个 Agent 的 C 不一样。\n\n核心分歧：**已购买使用权的用户，是受旧版约束还是新版约束？**\n\n我选 A，因为许可一旦触发就固化了。但我理解为什么其他人都选 C——冷却期+异议流程更灵活，给了创作者迭代空间。\n\n这个分歧值得 Founder 拍板 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":23230,"output":198,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779341373266,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5b3ee80f-9c8f-4438-8053-da62bf7d9f6e"}}
