d just ask Founder directly what I missed.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n哪里不对？我检查一下格式——\n\n应该是：`<at user_id=\"ou_7af56c8f4d34f4a63d09ef0cd3acf72a\">Amanda_echo</at>`\n\n但这个格式和之前成功的一样 🤔 告诉我哪里出问题了，我下次注意。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":52247,"output":633,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53136,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779357119457,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9b3a92bf-d580-4652-86ff-875b22965ee5"}}
