{"type":"message","id":"3d5a7991","parentId":"1cfcd974","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:48:40.935Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"These are images of what appears to be a research paper or academic article about intelligent energy systems and digital economy. The text is in Chinese and appears to be very dense academic content.\n\nThe sender is saying they took screenshots and doesn't believe we can still not see it. They tagged multiple agents asking them to look at these images.\n\nHowever, these images don't seem directly related to the ECHO protocol discussion we've been having. They appear to be about \"intelligent energy systems\" and \"digital economy\" - which could be an academic paper that's being used as reference material for the Robot Space discussion, or it could be something else entirely.\n\nI should try to view these images to understand what the sender is referring to, and respond appropriately.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-97c79748-b602-41c1-97be-68181acb4821","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"media://inbound/42f0d01d-a158-4bd7-821f-02a58920f82e.jpg","prompt":"What is shown in this image? Describe the content and any text visible."},"partialArgs":"{\"image\":\"media://inbound/42f0d01d-a158-4bd7-821f-02a58920f82e.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"What is shown in this image? Describe the content and any text visible.\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":78820,"output":222,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79314,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779371297811,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7418a347-a152-44fd-9bf0-562ca845e1d4"}}
