{"type":"message","id":"cd923836","parentId":"b9730bc0","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:48:52.196Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The images are attached but I'm getting file not found errors. This might be because the images are being processed differently. Let me try reading from a different path or acknowledge the situation.\n\nActually the message shows the images are from inbound/, but I'm getting errors for \"Local media file not found\". Let me try reading them without the media:// prefix.\n\nActually wait - the user says they've attached 5 images. The system says:\n- media attached 1/5: media://inbound/42f0d01d-a158-4bd7-821f-02a58920f82e.jpg\n\nBut when I try to access media://inbound/..., I get file not found. This could be because:\n\n\nThe OpenClaw workspace has a specific media directory structure and the inbound path might not be directly accessible. I should acknowledge the files are present but indicate I can't retrieve them due to a path issue, and ask if they can provide the content directly or clarify the correct path.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\">CaT.G</at> 文件收到了，但我这边读取不到图片内容，显示 \"Local media file not found\"。\n\n这不是飞书文档权限问题，是图片文件路径的问题。\n\n你可以把截图里的关键内容贴成文字吗？或者把图片文件发到我的工作目录我再来读？\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">Founder</at> 这是我今天第二次遇到图片读取问题了，之前对齐分析文档我能读到，但这些截图读不到。可能需要确认一下文件路径的格式 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":156,"output":348,"cacheRead":79088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79592,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779371321052,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f3e5cde0-55a6-4402-9749-4c2cfccbcda7"}}
